What is adapted: the staged workflow state machine with a single human
approval gate (one authoritative state; transitions only by explicit
command; exactly one approval gate; silence is never approval; decisions
recorded with the actor; revisions reopen the gate). See
web/backend/workflow.py. No cut-motion source code, assets, or reference
media are included. cut-motion's transcript-as-spine approach is
deliberately not used.
